nymore I want to be able to  share my platform with other female  creators out there when it comes to  fitness I only know that much when but  when you're able to collaborate with  other like-minded people and when you're  able to collaborate with other people  who has you know different sets of  knowledge together you're able to share  so much more and I hope that you all  will continue to support her network I  know that some people find that you know  what I don't want any of this content  I just want Joanna's content let's be  open let's just stay open and I really  believe that all these contents will  offer you a lot more what's one thing  you wish you could do better  the more success you have it comes with  more responsibilities as well and with  more responsibilities  I'm always stressing myself out I'm  always pressurizing myself because I  feel that to a certain extent I'm not as  connected with you guys and that's what  I really feel before that when my  channel was a lot smaller when I have  less followers I could reply to each and  every one of you but now it is just  impossible so sometimes when I read the  comments sometimes when I scroll through  the comments I really want to reply to  all of you because I know that your  questions are really important to you  and you're really seeking help but at  the same time I just physically and  mentally and not able to answer to all  your questions so that's one thing I  really wish I could do better  hence that's the reason why I want to do  more of this type of videos to be able  to answer your questions and hopefully  help you through your fitness journey as  well but I hope you that I hope that you  guys will understand this and and yeah  that's one thing I really wish I could  do better and sometimes I do feel deep  down I really feel guilty about it right  guys I really hope you have enjoyed this  video I hope that you've got to know me  better on a personal level let me know  what other questions you have in the  comments below and do you know what  let's just do this more often let me  know what other questions you have and  hopefully I'll be able to stream live as  well in the future and do check out my  youtube channel subscribe if you haven't  yet done it I will be having a lot more  workout videos recipes and also fitness  tips coming your way and all the best
 

